+#   often be visually indistinguishable from simply restoring the center before
+#   marking it teal. That would weaken the D1 signal.
+# - To keep the variant observable without changing the task family, the
+#   generator requires a substantial fraction of dent centers to sit within one
+#   cell of background or the opposite region, while still keeping some interior
+#   dents. This preserves repeated evidence for "same-side repair" in 2-4 ARC
+#   examples without adding extra subcases.
