+#   often be visually indistinguishable from simply restoring the center before
+#   marking it teal. That would weaken the D1 signal.
+# - To keep the variant observable without changing the task family, the
+#   generator requires visible edge-adjacent dents for both foreground colors,
+#   while still keeping many interior dents. This preserves repeated evidence
+#   for "same-side repair" in 2-4 ARC examples without over-constraining layout
